仕方ないなぁ。アンリがそう言うなら、しばらく待ってやるか！","nextNodeIds":[740430306]},{"nodeId":740430306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":681498426,"text":"しばらくして…","nextNodeIds":[740430307]},{"nodeId":740430307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21028,"speakerName":"「ボス」","textMapHash":2214967866,"text":"やあアンリ、状況はどうだい？","nextNodeIds":[740430308]},{"nodeId":740430308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":2168247250,"text":"順調ですよ、ボス！お探しの7つの不思議なコア、全部集まりました。ほら、紹介しますよ。協力者の…えっと、何て名前だっけ？","nextNodeIds":[740430309]},{"nodeId":740430309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":417549250,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[740430310]},{"nodeId":740430310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21028,"speakerName":"「ボス」","textMapHash":4236337778,"text":"えっと…","nextNodeIds":[740430311]},{"nodeId":740430311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3217973858,"text":"うっ…","nextNodeIds":[740430312]},{"nodeId":740430312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":1609115386,"text":"あれ、もしかして顔見知りだったの？ならちょうどいいや！そういうわけでして、ボス…","nextNodeIds":[740430315]},{"nodeId":740430313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":4222999018,"text":"#「ええっ！{NICKNAME}！どうして{NICKNAME}がここに！？」\\n「ボス」は踵を返して逃亡したが、どこからか現れたハンターとターナーに取り押さえられた！\\n\\n","nextNodeIds":[740430314]},{"nodeId":740430315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21028,"speakerName":"「ボス」","textMapHash":648293570,"text":"うわあっ、お助けを！","nextNodeIds":[740430316]},{"nodeId":740430316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2102398594,"text":"わぁ、あの二人…手慣れてるな…","nextNodeIds":[740430317]},{"nodeId":740430317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":3894257354,"text":"ボス、大丈夫です。命の危険はありません！","nextNodeIds":[740430318]},{"nodeId":740430318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":3231620770,"text":"ああ、もちろん。命の危険なんてないに決まってる。","nextNodeIds":[740430319]},{"nodeId":740430319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":2430657202,"text":"今のところは、な。","nextNodeIds":[740430320]},{"nodeId":740430320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21028,"speakerName":"「ボス」","textMapHash":2032702186,"text":"い、今のところは…！？","nextNodeIds":[740430321]},{"nodeId":740430321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":3655730546,"text":"さて、この次は…","nextNodeIds":[740430322]},{"nodeId":740430322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":2372963482,"text":"ローストチキンか、あるいは…それ以外だな。ボスさんよ、あんたの態度次第ってことだ。","nextNodeIds":[740430323]},{"nodeId":740430323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21028,"speakerName":"「ボス」","textMapHash":2514649762,"text":"ああっ——！","nextNodeIds":[740430324]},{"nodeId":740430324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1725395914,"text":"お前ら、どうしてここにいるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[740430325]},{"nodeId":740430325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":456465762,"text":"前に偶然会ってから…アンリを監視することにしたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[740430326]},{"nodeId":740430326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":282782906,"text":"待ってくれ、どうして僕を監視するんだ？","nextNodeIds":[740430327]},{"nodeId":740430327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":4128253314,"text":"いや、そもそも…なんで僕をつけ狙うんだ！ただ仕事に勤しんでただけじゃないか！","nextNodeIds":[740430328]},{"nodeId":740430328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":1324101322,"text":"お前の壊した機械…あれはフォンテーヌ科学院の人間が水質のモニタリングと改善に使う装置だったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[740430329]},{"nodeId":740430329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":3009736010,"text":"えっ？汚染を作り出す機械じゃなかったのか？","nextNodeIds":[740430330]},{"nodeId":740430330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":4242322082,"text":"取り出したコアには、最先端のムーブメントとフォンテーヌの水文データが含まれてる。俺たちは…お前の取引先とお近づきになりたいのさ。","nextNodeIds":[740430331]},{"nodeId":740430331,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":4200721290,"text":"え…えっ？なんで？どうして？","nextNodeIds":[740430332,740430334]},{"nodeId":740430332,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3614879186,"text":"アンリ！騙したんだね！","nextNodeIds":[740430333]},{"nodeId":740430334,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":985393170,"text":"ショック！騙された！","nextNodeIds":[740430335]},{"nodeId":740430333,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":1270657826,"text":"いやいや！君は僕の恩人なんだ、騙すわけないだろ！","nextNodeIds":[740430335]},{"nodeId":740430335,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":1146126754,"text":"ボス、なんで嘘をついたんですか！大事な機械を壊しちゃったじゃないですかっ！","nextNodeIds":[740430336]},{"nodeId":740430336,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21028,"speakerName":"「ボス」","textMapHash":884585394,"text":"わ、私の意志でやったんじゃない…私は単なる末端の…","nextNodeIds":[740430337]},{"nodeId":740430337,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":1342070730,"text":"ああ？ボスさんよ。いま「私の意志じゃない」って聞こえたが…もう一回言ってくれるか？","nextNodeIds":[740430338]},{"nodeId":740430338,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21028,"speakerName":"「ボス」","textMapHash":1136639522,"text":"ああ——","nextNodeIds":[740430339]},{"nodeId":740430339,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":2147310818,"text":"相当参ってるみたいだな。目を開けたまま気絶しやがった。","nextNodeIds":[740430340]},{"nodeId":740430340,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2031021810,"text":"うう、お、オイラたちだってわざとじゃ…","nextNodeIds":[740430341]},{"nodeId":740430341,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":683215058,"text":"ああ、それについてはお咎めなしってことになった。","nextNodeIds":[740430342]},{"nodeId":740430342,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2904852282,"text":"えっ？いいのか？","nextNodeIds":[740430343]},{"nodeId":740430343,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":2767376210,"text":"コアと中のデータさえ無事なら、機械なんてどうでもいい。","nextNodeIds":[740430344]},{"nodeId":740430344,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":3211379074,"text":"ま、表向きはな。どのみちあんたらに難癖はつけられないからしょうがない。","nextNodeIds":[740430345]},{"nodeId":740430345,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3533069770,"text":"難癖はつけられないってどういうこと？","nextNodeIds":[740430346]},{"nodeId":740430346,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":1620309546,"text":"いや、何でも無い。ほら…","nextNodeIds":[740430347]},{"nodeId":740430347,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":4052878514,"text":"俺たちはただ散歩してただけだ。","nextNodeIds":[740430348]},{"nodeId":740430348,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":3460660234,"text":"ホントに偶然だな。こんなにいい天気の日に会えるなんて。","nextNodeIds":[740430349]},{"nodeId":740430349,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":4140597834,"text":"だが、出会った限りいつかは別れが来るんだ。そろそろ…おさらばするぜ。","nextNodeIds":[740430350]},{"nodeId":740430350,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":1438456986,"text":"この美しい出会いを心に留めておくか、あるいは…","nextNodeIds":[740430351]},{"nodeId":740430351,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":720083114,"text":"いいや、忘れたほうがいい。","nextNodeIds":[740430352]},{"nodeId":740430352,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":539192994,"text":"えーと…僕たち、もう行っていいの？","nextNodeIds":[740430353]},{"nodeId":740430353,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":2410075410,"text":"何だ。他に何かあるのか？","nextNodeIds":[740430354]},{"nodeId":740430354,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":3125457138,"text":"いやいや、まさか！ハハッ、何にもないって！","nextNodeIds":[740430355]},{"nodeId":740430355,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":2028231562,"text":"はぁ…親切な人に出会って、ようやく労働を通して運命を変えられるって思ったのに…やっぱり世の中は悪いやつだらけだ！","nextNodeIds":[740430356]},{"nodeId":740430356,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":3033301882,"text":"…おい、アンリ。ちょっと手を貸せ。","nextNodeIds":[740430357]},{"nodeId":740430357,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":4132474642,"text":"え？","nextNodeIds":[740430358]},{"nodeId":740430358,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":1107487954,"text":"不幸なことに、この親切なボスは意識を失った。","nextNodeIds":[740430359]},{"nodeId":740430359,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":3029729130,"text":"そこで…","nextNodeIds":[740430360]},{"nodeId":740430360,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":1481561338,"text":"仕事に対して真摯で——","nextNodeIds":[740430361]},{"nodeId":740430361,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":1250025898,"text":"忠実で信頼できる——","nextNodeIds":[740430362]},{"nodeId":740430362,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":4163451946,"text":"労働で運命を変えたいと考える…相棒が必要だ。","nextNodeIds":[740430363]},{"nodeId":740430363,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":3467351730,"text":"そういうこった。相棒、この「いい男」を俺たちの隠れ家に運ぶのを手伝ってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[740430364]},{"nodeId":740430364,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21091,"speakerName":"ハンター","textMapHash":78796738,"text":"この機会に…ボスさんと話がしたくてな。","nextNodeIds":[740430365]},{"nodeId":740430365,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21092,"speakerName":"ターナー","textMapHash":4150251106,"text":"ああ。もちろんしっかり…感謝を示すつもりだぜ——モラでな。","nextNodeIds":[740430366]},{"nodeId":740430366,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":76216802,"text":"えっ？うん！もちろん手伝うよ！","nextNodeIds":[740430367]},{"nodeId":740430367,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":3973048714,"text":"よかった！本当にありがとうございます！君たちにも感謝するよ、えっと…","nextNodeIds":[740430368]},{"nodeId":740430368,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1959656914,"text":"#{NICKNAME}と、こっちはパイモン。","nextNodeIds":[740430369]},{"nodeId":740430369,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":1387338050,"text":"#ありがとう、{NICKNAME}にパイモン！君たちに出会ってから僕の運命は変わり始めた！","nextNodeIds":[740430370]},{"nodeId":740430370,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3240976186,"text":"いいって！頑張れよ、アンリ！もう騙されるんじゃないぞ～！","nextNodeIds":[740430371]},{"nodeId":740430371,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21105,"speakerName":"アンリ","textMapHash":667548114,"text":"ああ！肝に銘じておくよ。頑張って働いてお金持ちになるんだ！今後人を雇うことがあったら、ぜひ僕に声をかけてくれよ！","nextNodeIds":[740430372]},{"nodeId":740430372,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":741462874,"text":"ハンター、ターナーの二人とアンリは意識を失ったファデュイを掘り出し、連れて行った。","nextNodeIds":[740430373]},{"nodeId":740430373,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1381554794,"text":"アンリのやつ、幸せになれるといいな…","nextNodeIds":[740430374]},{"nodeId":740430374,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":126768298,"text":"…待て！あいつが約束したオイラたちへの報酬は！？","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7404303,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133403307,1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","1334